4
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:38,060
Yes, it's been my dream since I was a girl.

5
00:00:39,940 --> 00:00:41,940
Oh, well...

6
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:14,120
You know you can no longer continue living this way.

7
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,940
Come with me into the spotlight.

8
00:01:19,640 --> 00:01:22,120
Actors, designers, performers, filmmakers.

9
00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:24,120
Time to take the stage.

10
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:24,940
Come on, let's go.

11
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:26,660
I get your prize, honey.

12
00:01:26,740 --> 00:01:29,000
I'll take it to your latter dreams.

13
00:01:29,460 --> 00:01:31,460
Theaters, look at that marquee.

14
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:33,460
And parties full of celebrities.

15
00:01:34,160 --> 00:01:36,460
Painting, pounding, paparazzi, too.

16
00:01:36,540 --> 00:01:38,700
Till the day your name is on the walk of fame.

17
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:41,740
Don't stop now, dream big.

18
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:44,440
But beware, don't forget.

19
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:47,740
If your restless feet should trip and fall.

20
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:50,620
There's no turning back from your calling.

21
00:01:51,320 --> 00:01:52,380
You know it's true.

22
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:55,340
What may look from afar like diamonds

23
00:01:55,340 --> 00:01:58,840
are actually a poor romantic's tears.

24
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:02,200
But don't give up and don't give in.

25
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,820
You have to keep that dream alive.

26
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,980
Dance on fire.

27
00:02:10,420 --> 00:02:12,360
Time to heat things up now.

28
00:02:12,660 --> 00:02:14,380
Dance on fire.

29
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,820
Go on with your song and dance.

30
00:02:16,980 --> 00:02:18,440
You may be burnt out.

31
00:02:18,580 --> 00:02:20,980
But your dreams, they keep on blazing.

32
00:02:20,980 --> 00:02:22,900
Beating on and on.

33
00:02:23,020 --> 00:02:26,320
And so slow for your close-up.

34
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:30,820
And roll, roll.

35
00:02:30,820 --> 00:02:34,580
Great!

36
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:36,340
