40
00:02:42,400 --> 00:02:43,600
Let's move those cranes!

41
00:02:48,460 --> 00:02:49,300
Great job.

42
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,900
As always, Miss Dia.

43
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,680
