90
00:04:48,660 --> 00:04:52,600
With the right lead, Pompo can transform any screenplay into a good movie.

91
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:57,360
The truth is, making the audience cry is actually pretty easy.

92
00:04:57,900 --> 00:05:01,120
Making them fall in love with something vapid takes a stroke of genius.

93
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:03,580
Oh, I guess that makes a lot of sense.

