152
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:17,060
His eye for spotting great scripts, actors, directors, his charisma, his decisiveness.

153
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:22,060
Everything needed to produce great movies, making her a silver screen prodigy.

154
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:28,060
