Mr. Director?

218
00:12:41,060 --> 00:12:42,060
Hmm...

219
00:12:46,060 --> 00:12:48,060
That's Pompo, isn't it?

220
00:12:48,060 --> 00:12:50,060
Yes, that's right.

221
00:12:50,060 --> 00:12:51,060
Oh!

222
00:12:51,060 --> 00:12:54,060
Yeah, I remember waving to Mistia right after we rapped.

223
00:12:54,060 --> 00:12:56,060
Why would you include that shot?

224
00:12:56,060 --> 00:12:57,060
Uh...

225
00:12:57,060 --> 00:12:58,060
Well...

226
00:12:58,060 --> 00:13:02,060
I wanted to mislead the audience to create some buzz.

227
00:13:02,060 --> 00:13:04,060
And I happened to find that footage.

228
00:13:04,060 --> 00:13:07,060
I messed up, didn't I?

229
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:09,060
Hmm...

230
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:15,060
It's great!

231
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:16,060
Uh...

232
00:13:16,060 --> 00:13:17,060
I love it!

233
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:18,060
Huh?

234
00:13:18,060 --> 00:13:21,060
So Gene can make the 30-second, two-minute, and online versions, right?

235
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:22,060
Works for me!

236
00:13:25,060 --> 00:13:27,060
Thank you so much!

237
00:13:27,060 --> 00:13:37,060
I saw you.

238
00:13:37,060 --> 00:13:41,060
You were talking to my grandpa yesterday.

239
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:43,060
You know, I didn't expect that.

240
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:44,060
Yeah, that's right.

241
00:13:44,060 --> 00:13:47,060
