267
00:14:50,060 --> 00:14:53,060
The expanse and depth of an outcast's inner world

268
00:14:53,060 --> 00:14:57,060
is directly correlated to their untapped creative potential.

269
00:14:57,060 --> 00:15:00,060
And that's why I put my faith in a complete loner.

270
00:15:00,060 --> 00:15:02,060
Like you.

271
00:15:04,060 --> 00:15:06,060
Because it's all in the eyes.

272
00:15:06,060 --> 00:15:07,060
Oh, I see.

273
