475
00:23:16,120 --> 00:23:16,360
Whoa!

476
00:23:16,360 --> 00:23:20,100
No, no, no,

477
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:21,280
I can't sleep.

478
00:23:21,700 --> 00:23:23,620
