481
00:23:34,320 --> 00:23:35,160
I'm late.

482
00:23:35,500 --> 00:23:36,340
I'm late.

483
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:38,540
Oh!

484
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:38,640
Oh!

485
