526
00:25:16,760 --> 00:25:19,100
Uh, Natalie Woodward.

527
00:25:19,360 --> 00:25:24,360
Born in Sun Road, a town known for its corn, zero acting experience.

528
00:25:24,880 --> 00:25:26,260
What are you currently doing to make money?

529
00:25:26,260 --> 00:25:28,400
Oh, well, I have a part-time job.

530
