What?

1399
01:13:20,000 --> 01:13:22,840
Our documentary is also available online.

1400
01:13:23,480 --> 01:13:24,740
What's more...

1401
01:13:24,740 --> 01:13:26,380
You're crowdfunding it?

1402
01:13:26,380 --> 01:13:28,640
We launched this website a few days ago.

1403
01:13:29,320 --> 01:13:31,620
This was how much we raised on the very first day.

1404
01:13:32,120 --> 01:13:33,580
And this is the fun now.

1405
01:13:34,180 --> 01:13:37,120
And the campaign is approaching two million views.

1406
01:13:43,900 --> 01:13:46,540
So, how do you like those figures?

1407
01:13:48,900 --> 01:13:51,700
Now, that's the conclusion of my presentation.

1408
01:13:51,700 --> 01:13:59,240
Cut the stream.

1409
01:14:03,440 --> 01:14:06,120
